WEBVTT

00:00:00.709 --> 00:00:01.794
Constructing Unrestricted System:

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:04.130
Qadesh's Blood Pulse.

00:00:04.338 --> 00:00:05.756
Deploying-

00:00:27.236 --> 00:00:28.863
Yahoo!

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:35.911
Wh-What's going on?

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:37.496
What's happening?

00:00:37.705 --> 00:00:38.873
Trouble!

00:00:39.081 --> 00:00:44.086
The destroyer... Th-The Mobilizer of
Ceremonial Equipment is outside the palace!

00:00:44.295 --> 00:00:45.713
What?

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:54.680
Th-That's...

00:00:54.889 --> 00:00:56.724
That explosion is...

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:06.108
What's wrong?

00:01:06.317 --> 00:01:08.110
Where's Sydonay?

00:01:08.319 --> 00:01:10.988
Where's the Trinity?

00:01:11.864 --> 00:01:13.490
The Scatterer of Sparkling Light...

00:01:13.699 --> 00:01:16.410
Why did it have to be them, of all people?

00:01:16.619 --> 00:01:20.623
All forces begin attack.
Where are Puruson and Uvall?

00:01:22.166 --> 00:01:23.792
No...

00:01:24.001 --> 00:01:25.628
Magnesia!

00:01:43.854 --> 00:01:47.316
That didn't even budge it?

00:01:47.524 --> 00:01:48.025
Yeah...

00:01:48.234 --> 00:01:51.487
That would be the Tempest Hoof's
Unrestricted Spell, Magnesia.

00:01:51.695 --> 00:01:56.408
He was appointed to guard
the Palace of the Stars for a reason.

00:01:58.285 --> 00:02:02.456
L-I managed to protect the
Divine Gate in time...

00:02:02.665 --> 00:02:03.916
Sir Fecor!

00:02:04.124 --> 00:02:05.751
Your orders?

00:02:05.960 --> 00:02:08.128
I shall maintain Magnesia from here.

00:02:08.337 --> 00:02:11.215
Puruson, you are to
command from the front lines.

00:02:11.423 --> 00:02:13.092
Uvall, discover how they came here,

00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:17.346
and verify that no one
else has accompanied them.

00:02:17.554 --> 00:02:22.726
And tell the maids to have the
princess evacuated to the lower levels.

00:02:22.935 --> 00:02:23.644
Understood.

00:02:23.852 --> 00:02:25.729
Leave it to us.

00:02:29.108 --> 00:02:31.694
But how is it possible...

00:02:34.655 --> 00:02:35.739
Do you hear me,

00:02:35.948 --> 00:02:37.116
Decarabia, Officer of Boundless Seas

00:02:37.324 --> 00:02:40.202
and Supreme Commander of the
Offensive Forces attacking Outlaw.

00:02:41.161 --> 00:02:43.998
I have been listening and watching,

00:02:44.206 --> 00:02:47.376
Fortress Commander, Tempest Hoof Fecor.

00:02:47.584 --> 00:02:51.171
Do you know how they
penetrated our defensive forces,

00:02:51.380 --> 00:02:53.882
to enter the Palace of the Stars?

00:02:54.091 --> 00:02:57.219
Our outer defenses
have not been penetrated.

00:02:57.428 --> 00:03:00.431
Thus, no explanation is possible.

00:03:00.639 --> 00:03:02.141
Do any troops approach?

00:03:02.349 --> 00:03:03.142
No.

00:03:03.350 --> 00:03:04.101
Then“.

00:03:04.310 --> 00:03:07.104
By morning, nearby reinforcements
will have arrived here

00:03:07.313 --> 00:03:10.607
and will begin to search
the area surrounding the fortress.

00:03:10.816 --> 00:03:12.651
Until then...

00:03:12.860 --> 00:03:14.695
Very well.

00:03:14.903 --> 00:03:18.282
Until our master's return,
we must bolster Crypta, the Divine Gate,

00:03:18.490 --> 00:03:20.868
and the very fortress itself!

00:03:24.913 --> 00:03:26.332
This is it.

00:03:27.624 --> 00:03:30.586
This is the change I've been waiting for!

00:03:52.274 --> 00:03:55.903
<i>Now set free</i>

00:03:56.111 --> 00:04:02.284
<i>Your hidden feelings</i>

00:04:02.493 --> 00:04:06.163
<i>So that you may sever</i>

00:04:06.372 --> 00:04:12.211
<i>Reality that returns to nothingness</i>

00:04:12.419 --> 00:04:14.755
<i>Even if fate is inevitable</i>

00:04:14.963 --> 00:04:17.383
<i>Nobody can predict what will happen</i>

00:04:17.591 --> 00:04:19.927
<i>Defy it with all you've got</i>

00:04:20.135 --> 00:04:24.807
<i>Grasp the future reflected in</i>

00:04:25.015 --> 00:04:27.351
<i>Your eyes with your own hands</i>

00:04:27.559 --> 00:04:30.020
<i>Shout out</i>

00:04:30.229 --> 00:04:32.648
<i>Your existence</i>

00:04:32.856 --> 00:04:37.736
<i>Cry out</i>

00:04:37.945 --> 00:04:40.155
<i>Shout out</i>

00:04:40.531 --> 00:04:42.908
<i>Shout out</i>

00:04:43.117 --> 00:04:45.494
<i>No matter what hardship</i>

00:04:45.702 --> 00:04:53.544
<i>Awaits us down the way</i>

00:04:53.752 --> 00:05:00.134
<i>Light my fire</i>

00:05:12.896 --> 00:05:17.359
Lady Shana, the castle will
soon become a dangerous place.

00:05:17.568 --> 00:05:22.114
We have been ordered to take you
to the lower levels, where it will be safe.

00:05:22.322 --> 00:05:24.158
Please follow us.

00:05:36.336 --> 00:05:37.921
Please hurry.

00:05:38.672 --> 00:05:39.756
Not yet...

00:05:39.965 --> 00:05:42.593
Right now, I'm still only as
powerful as a normal person.

00:05:42.801 --> 00:05:45.929
If I were to attack,
I couldn't defeat even these Rinnes.

00:05:50.684 --> 00:05:51.727
So <i>I'll</i> wait...

00:05:51.935 --> 00:05:53.645
For a bigger change...

00:05:53.854 --> 00:05:55.481
For my opening to counterattack!

00:05:57.941 --> 00:06:00.986
"To the Palace of the Stars"

00:06:04.656 --> 00:06:08.285
Yeah, that Unrestricted Method
is said to be impregnable.

00:06:08.494 --> 00:06:12.331
Wanna just blast away
at the whole castle?

00:06:12.539 --> 00:06:15.626
Kill any who come out?

00:06:15.834 --> 00:06:17.336
Or maybe...

00:06:24.551 --> 00:06:27.304
Should we smoke out Fecor
from wherever he cowers?

00:06:27.513 --> 00:06:31.266
Ah, I believe it would be unwise
to underestimate the Tempest Hoof.

00:06:31.475 --> 00:06:34.853
He is quite powerful himself.

00:06:35.062 --> 00:06:38.440
For our part, we'd like to destroy
the Crypta that conceals the fortress,

00:06:38.649 --> 00:06:42.444
before they can recover from the confusion.

00:06:42.653 --> 00:06:44.530
Since we insisted on being allowed here,

00:06:44.738 --> 00:06:48.450
we should contribute something
to aid the sneak attack force.

00:06:50.202 --> 00:06:52.120
"I'm glad they're on our side,"

00:06:52.329 --> 00:06:55.082
is the phrase that would apply to them...

00:06:55.290 --> 00:06:56.959
Anyway,

00:06:59.836 --> 00:07:03.882
we haven't encountered
any problems so far!

00:07:04.091 --> 00:07:05.717
Excellent sign.

00:07:06.468 --> 00:07:10.973
No one will be expecting
an attack from within, indeed.

00:07:11.181 --> 00:07:12.724
We would not have considered it,

00:07:12.933 --> 00:07:16.728
were it not for the
Palace of Heaven's Road.

00:07:17.980 --> 00:07:20.190
The Palace of Heaven's Road
and the Palace of the Stars

00:07:20.399 --> 00:07:22.526
must never be brought together.

00:07:22.734 --> 00:07:26.780
Oh, the Soaring Tower
of Quintessence, Gavida.

00:07:26.989 --> 00:07:28.991
I haven't heard that name in a long time.

00:07:29.199 --> 00:07:30.033
It was he who created

00:07:30.242 --> 00:07:33.912
both Palace of Heaven's Road
and the Palace of the Stars.

00:07:34.121 --> 00:07:37.082
But what did he mean when he said
they must not be brought together?

00:07:37.291 --> 00:07:41.253
The Palace of Heaven's Road is a
place of sun, meant to be filled with life.

00:07:41.461 --> 00:07:42.546
Temple of the stellar sky,

00:07:42.754 --> 00:07:44.923
the Palace of the Stars was
created to destroy its enemies.

00:07:45.132 --> 00:07:49.303
Together, the two were
originally a pair of Treasures.

00:07:49.511 --> 00:07:53.140
Thus, if the two come
within a certain distance,

00:07:53.348 --> 00:07:58.645
the path connecting them,
currently severed, will regenerate.

00:07:59.521 --> 00:08:02.608
In other words,
Ball Masque's headquarters

00:08:02.816 --> 00:08:05.694
will be directly next to us.

00:08:06.987 --> 00:08:10.991
So it's understandable why
he would forbid their reunion.

00:08:11.199 --> 00:08:15.287
But given the situation,
that is our sole way in.

00:08:15.495 --> 00:08:18.498
Nice location, then...

00:08:18.707 --> 00:08:20.917
Here is the path, indeed.

00:08:21.126 --> 00:08:22.711
Its proximity to the Palace of the Stars

00:08:22.919 --> 00:08:24.671
will automatically initiate its repair.

00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:26.923
Path opens.

00:08:27.132 --> 00:08:29.009
So this leads to the castle?

00:08:29.217 --> 00:08:29.885
Yes.

00:08:30.093 --> 00:08:34.723
But only luck can say
what we'll face on the other side.

00:08:34.931 --> 00:08:36.016
Yeah.

00:08:36.224 --> 00:08:40.354
Thus, it's possible it could lead directly
to the center of the enemy formation.

00:08:40.562 --> 00:08:42.564
Dangerous wager.

00:08:45.233 --> 00:08:48.236
This'll be fun... Let's go!

00:08:51.948 --> 00:08:56.620
We were fortunate that Gavida
never told Ball Masque about the path.

00:08:56.828 --> 00:08:58.330
Hatred helped.

00:08:58.538 --> 00:09:00.707
All that remains is to locate her.

00:09:00.916 --> 00:09:05.379
Only luck can say if
we'll be able to find her.

00:09:18.809 --> 00:09:20.811
Please hurry a bit more.

00:09:25.691 --> 00:09:30.737
If they take me some
place heavily guarded, it's over.

00:09:30.946 --> 00:09:32.823
I'll lose my chance...

00:09:34.074 --> 00:09:36.368
Come! Quickly!

00:09:36.576 --> 00:09:39.413
Anything... Just something big!

00:10:32.758 --> 00:10:35.552
Commander, the report.

00:10:35.761 --> 00:10:38.638
Operation Calm proceeds as scheduled.

00:10:38.847 --> 00:10:40.932
If we continue...

00:10:41.141 --> 00:10:43.018
ls something wrong?

00:10:43.226 --> 00:10:44.644
No.

00:10:45.270 --> 00:10:47.606
This operation was based upon
the coordinates we received,

00:10:47.814 --> 00:10:53.028
as well as upon our observations
of the mighty distortion

00:10:53.236 --> 00:10:55.530
that swept across the world.

00:10:56.656 --> 00:11:02.579
But what if that were all merely
a part of the enemy's plan?

00:11:02.788 --> 00:11:07.375
I cannot rid myself of that fear.

00:11:07.584 --> 00:11:13.632
The judgment and unease
it brings are a leader's burdens.

00:11:13.840 --> 00:11:15.759
I know that well.

00:11:15.967 --> 00:11:20.472
If you are uneasy, then let
the men share in your uneasiness,

00:11:20.680 --> 00:11:22.974
by having them investigate and confirm it.

00:11:23.183 --> 00:11:23.934
Of course,

00:11:24.142 --> 00:11:27.103
you will bear the responsibility, regardless.

00:11:30.649 --> 00:11:32.651
That really is an excellent idea.

00:11:41.117 --> 00:11:45.372
Balar, what do you make
of what you just witnessed?

00:11:45.580 --> 00:11:49.543
Hmm? Oh, that black mirror...

00:11:51.086 --> 00:11:52.671
I know not what it may be,

00:11:52.879 --> 00:11:55.715
but it's very likely connected
to the disruption we felt.

00:11:55.924 --> 00:12:00.178
We can probably assume it ranks
among Ball Masque's biggest secrets.

00:12:00.387 --> 00:12:01.805
Yeah...

00:12:02.764 --> 00:12:05.559
We're this deep in their territory,

00:12:05.767 --> 00:12:08.311
and not only haven't we seen that
Mystes, who's supposedly their master,

00:12:08.520 --> 00:12:11.439
we haven't seen a
single one of the Trinity.

00:12:11.648 --> 00:12:13.483
Which suggests...

00:12:16.820 --> 00:12:22.325
...the reason they aren't here
is because of that black mirror.

00:12:22.534 --> 00:12:25.954
Still, we don't know what might ensue,
should we simply blow it up.

00:12:26.162 --> 00:12:29.332
I'm sure the old men are well aware of that.

00:12:29.541 --> 00:12:30.250
Yeah.

00:12:30.458 --> 00:12:33.879
Regardless, until we're
able to neutralize Magnesia,

00:12:34.087 --> 00:12:36.089
nothing much will happen here!

00:12:37.716 --> 00:12:39.718
That's quite enough.

00:12:42.345 --> 00:12:46.016
You've both caused too much damage.

00:12:47.058 --> 00:12:49.394
Sorry about that...

00:12:49.603 --> 00:12:53.648
But it's what we're here for!

00:12:53.857 --> 00:12:55.275
I see.

00:12:55.483 --> 00:12:57.694
Then, I suppose

00:12:57.903 --> 00:13:01.281
I shall have to ask you to leave.

00:13:01.489 --> 00:13:04.618
I am Puruson,
the Majestic Lion's Bellowing Call.

00:13:04.826 --> 00:13:07.287
A pleasure to meet you.

00:13:07.495 --> 00:13:10.373
I'll be sure to have it put on your tomb!

00:13:13.668 --> 00:13:15.462
N-No way, that can't be...

00:13:15.670 --> 00:13:19.591
Only one person could possibly
make something that stupid.

00:13:19.799 --> 00:13:21.801
The Seeker...

00:13:22.010 --> 00:13:23.261
That jerk of a professor!

00:13:23.470 --> 00:13:24.930
Yeah.

00:13:25.138 --> 00:13:29.059
One meeting in a hundred
years is more than enough...

00:13:30.143 --> 00:13:33.563
It may appear foolish,
but as you can see, it's functional.

00:13:33.772 --> 00:13:38.193
Fighting warriors such
as yourselves is a daunting task.

00:13:38.401 --> 00:13:41.112
I will use everything I have at my disposal.

00:13:45.325 --> 00:13:46.952
Whoa!

00:13:49.037 --> 00:13:51.039
Old man, above you!

00:14:17.148 --> 00:14:18.108
Old man!

00:14:18.316 --> 00:14:24.030
How do you like the feel of my
Unrestricted System battle cry, the Lion's Roar?

00:14:27.075 --> 00:14:29.160
You did knock down the old man.

00:14:29.369 --> 00:14:33.248
So you did manage to accomplish
something, before your death.

00:14:33.456 --> 00:14:34.791
Hey, Balar.

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:38.294
Time for the kid gloves to come off.

00:14:38.503 --> 00:14:41.006
Be sure you stop when I tell you to.

00:14:50.932 --> 00:14:53.810
What am I doing?

00:14:56.479 --> 00:14:58.314
What am I doing?

00:14:59.607 --> 00:15:02.610
It's finally time.

00:15:02.819 --> 00:15:05.071
It's finally time for me to act...

00:15:07.699 --> 00:15:09.993
It's just this one thing...

00:15:11.286 --> 00:15:13.329
...that weakens me so.

00:15:21.421 --> 00:15:24.257
Power... I need power.

00:15:30.764 --> 00:15:36.978
Power... I must go...

00:15:38.646 --> 00:15:40.065
Move...

00:15:40.774 --> 00:15:42.192
Move!

00:15:45.737 --> 00:15:47.989
Move... Move!

00:16:00.168 --> 00:16:01.586
Move.

00:16:02.545 --> 00:16:04.047
Even an inch!

00:16:23.608 --> 00:16:25.693
Please stop...

00:16:34.869 --> 00:16:36.788
Please stop.

00:16:55.807 --> 00:16:58.977
Please stop.
Please stop.

00:16:59.185 --> 00:17:00.854
Please stop...

00:17:01.062 --> 00:17:02.105
Please stop.

00:17:02.313 --> 00:17:04.149
Please stop...

00:17:14.075 --> 00:17:15.493
Where...

00:17:17.996 --> 00:17:19.914
Where is it?

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:24.419
Where is it?!

00:17:27.380 --> 00:17:29.632
The Nietono no Shana!

00:17:33.636 --> 00:17:35.054
What was that sound?

00:17:35.263 --> 00:17:37.682
It seemed to come from inside.

00:17:45.523 --> 00:17:47.984
Th-That's...

00:17:48.193 --> 00:17:50.236
...my master.

00:17:50.445 --> 00:17:52.071
Tenmokuikko!

00:18:13.927 --> 00:18:15.678
Master...

00:18:15.887 --> 00:18:17.513
'90 t0 you.

00:18:19.224 --> 00:18:22.560
Repeated investigation has failed
to reveal any sign of their entrance.

00:18:22.769 --> 00:18:24.687
None of the outer defenses were pierced.

00:18:24.896 --> 00:18:27.565
And if they came in by breaking the Crypta,

00:18:29.067 --> 00:18:32.570
this Trivia should
betray some sign of that.

00:18:32.779 --> 00:18:36.407
How did they get past all our defenses?

00:18:36.616 --> 00:18:39.452
It's like they just
appeared, inside the castle...

00:18:40.954 --> 00:18:42.455
Inside the castle?

00:18:42.664 --> 00:18:43.665
Right...

00:18:43.873 --> 00:18:46.626
It was like they
just appeared, inside the castle.

00:18:46.834 --> 00:18:50.630
If they came from within,
and not from without...

00:18:52.173 --> 00:18:55.969
Wait! I'm overlooking something here.

00:18:56.177 --> 00:18:57.136
That reminds me,

00:18:57.345 --> 00:19:01.057
the Mobilizer of Ceremonial Equipment
came to Misaki City once before.

00:19:01.266 --> 00:19:04.435
The Specialist of Everything
was there, as well.

00:19:04.644 --> 00:19:08.064
Both she and the former
Flame-Haired Burning-Eyed Slayer

00:19:08.273 --> 00:19:10.900
learned of Palace of Heaven's Road
from the Soaring Tower of Quintessence.

00:19:12.443 --> 00:19:14.279
The Palace of Heaven's Road!

00:19:14.487 --> 00:19:17.448
The mobile citadel,
created in tandem with this fortress.

00:19:17.657 --> 00:19:20.702
If it held some
secret we were unaware of...

00:19:20.910 --> 00:19:23.454
If there were a path
between them, leading here...

00:19:23.663 --> 00:19:28.376
If the Specialist of Everything
were also here with them...

00:19:28.584 --> 00:19:31.754
They plan not merely to destroy
the Palace of the Stars,

00:19:31.963 --> 00:19:33.965
but to recover the princess.

00:19:35.717 --> 00:19:37.176
Sir Fecor!

00:19:38.761 --> 00:19:41.139
Come quickly--

00:19:41.347 --> 00:19:42.974
T-Tenmoku...

00:19:49.355 --> 00:19:51.649
Balar! Look at that!

00:19:51.858 --> 00:19:52.900
It can't be.

00:19:53.109 --> 00:19:53.818
Hey, old man!

00:19:54.027 --> 00:19:55.611
Yes, that's...

00:19:55.820 --> 00:19:57.613
--indeed.
--What?

00:19:57.822 --> 00:19:59.115
That's...

00:19:59.324 --> 00:20:01.576
It can't be! Sir Fecor...

00:20:02.910 --> 00:20:04.829
They're so fast!

00:20:15.965 --> 00:20:17.008
N-No!

00:20:17.216 --> 00:20:19.218
Go for it!

00:20:58.674 --> 00:21:00.301
Welcome back.

00:21:15.441 --> 00:21:16.859
Thank you.

00:21:18.736 --> 00:21:23.241
Powerful warrior... My master...

00:21:36.421 --> 00:21:38.297
Let's get 905F19-

00:21:57.817 --> 00:22:00.778
<i>If the luster that made you shine</i>

00:22:00.987 --> 00:22:04.365
<i>ls also inside of me,
(then I'm sure that we can go)</i>

00:22:04.574 --> 00:22:07.535
<i>I will go and prove everything</i>

00:22:07.743 --> 00:22:13.499
<i>It is the reason why I continue to exist</i>

00:22:13.708 --> 00:22:14.792
<i>Inside of Kaos I say</i>

00:22:15.001 --> 00:22:18.087
<i>Where can I get the
real love and fate, right now?</i>

00:22:18.296 --> 00:22:21.424
<i>How can I make you
know my heart is with you hey?</i>

00:22:21.632 --> 00:22:24.844
<i>All people, everyone, forget things,</i>

00:22:25.052 --> 00:22:28.222
<i>Even their aching scars</i>

00:22:28.431 --> 00:22:31.559
<i>Each time I see the passage of time,</i>

00:22:31.767 --> 00:22:34.937
<i>These emotions fade</i>

00:22:35.146 --> 00:22:38.858
<i>But I don't want to
overlook things any longer</i>

00:22:39.066 --> 00:22:41.777
<i>Back and forth, the screaming
in my heart won't stop (time over)</i>

00:22:41.986 --> 00:22:48.326
<i>The vanishing afterimage,
that is you in and of itself</i>

00:22:48.534 --> 00:22:50.036
<i>So now that you & I</i>

00:22:50.244 --> 00:22:51.287
<i>I can't live life</i>

00:22:51.496 --> 00:22:53.247
<i>Without you by my side...</i>

00:22:53.456 --> 00:22:56.876
<i>"I'll believe..." Even in the
fatality of solitude (Yeah, yeah)</i>

00:22:57.084 --> 00:23:00.213
<i>The fragments of the burning records</i>

00:23:00.421 --> 00:23:03.633
<i>Reflect tomorrow's brightness
(Can see your light)</i>

00:23:03.841 --> 00:23:06.677
<i>If the luster that made you shine</i>

00:23:06.886 --> 00:23:10.431
<i>ls also inside of me,
(then I'm sure that we can go)</i>

00:23:10.640 --> 00:23:13.559
<i>I will go and prove everything</i>

00:23:13.768 --> 00:23:22.276
<i>"I'll believe..." in a tomorrow
where we coexist, (Yeah, "I'll believe")</i>

00:23:25.863 --> 00:23:29.867
With the Nietono no Shana in
her hands, Shana fights to test her power.

00:23:30.076 --> 00:23:30.826
Meanwhile,

00:23:31.035 --> 00:23:33.412
the Outlaws leave Zurich

00:23:33.621 --> 00:23:34.872
to launch an attack
on the Palace of the Stars.

00:23:35.081 --> 00:23:36.374
The operation is named...

00:23:36.582 --> 00:23:38.584
Next time,
on Shakugan no Shana Final:

00:23:38.793 --> 00:23:39.835
"Crossing."
